0..77 Comment "// A clause owes the rest of its scope exactly one end once that rest holds a"
78..154 Comment "// task\'s end. A clause that neither resumes nor abandons it would leave the"
155..222 Comment "// end open with no one left to close it, so the clause is refused."
223..225 Comment "//"
226..255 Comment "// - see: #1334 — `dropped`"
